  {
   "text": "the super intelligence shit is a humiliation ritual for openAI and the sector more broadly, to see if they change their name I think. I unfortunately think it's actual in terms of regime politics relatively smart.",
   "handle": "opinionhaver.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "William B. Fuckley",
   "likes": 682,
