   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "OpenAI"
  },
  {
   "text": "2. But Anthropic researchers say they see patterns that suggest that Claude can.\n\nThe employees at Anthropic are telling themselves stories based on the words they input into the software and the words that come back out. \n\n>>",
   "handle": "emilymbender.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Emily M. Bender",
   "likes": 422,
   "reposts": 52,
   "replies": 7,
   "created_at": "2026-10-09T19:06:56.628Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emilymbender.bsky.social/post/3mxhoapa3ds2k",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "Anthropic"
  },
  {
   "text": "ok it was more than a couple of days but here it is: xo, for people with ADHD who would like to use AI agents to help them with that.\n\nthe idea is that this gets you moving from a standing start:  you set up your agent and then your agent helps you set up your agentic environment.\n\nhope it helps.",
   "handle": "proptermalone.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "ghost malone ergo propter bones",
   "likes": 430,
   "reposts": 33,
   "replies": 32,
   "created_at": "2026-10-08T22:47:16.499Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/proptermalone.bsky.social/post/3mxfk3r7tl22q",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "AI agent"
  },
  {
   "text": "So, you don’t have to hand it to Anthropic because it’s weird to talk mean to its talking word toaster. It’s not real.",
   "handle": "tressiemcphd.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Tressie McMillan Cottom",
   "likes": 442,
   "reposts": 25,
   "replies": 2,
   "created_at": "2026-10-08T18:49:40.724Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/tressiemcphd.bsky.social/post/3mxf4svu2ds23",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "Anthropic"
  },
  {
   "text": "So the issue is “allow people to…“ which supposes an authority without naming one. Name it and then explain why Anthropic or any of the rest of them should have that authority.",
   "handle": "tressiemcphd.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Tressie McMillan Cottom",
   "likes": 384,
   "reposts": 54,
   "replies": 4,
   "created_at": "2026-10-09T15:30:18.682Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/tressiemcphd.bsky.social/post/3mxhc5dgcns27",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "Anthropic"
  },
  {
   "text": "Notable that Anthropic is more interested in protecting Claude from humans than humans from Claude.",
   "handle": "rebeccasolnit.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Rebecca Solnit",
   "likes": 302,
   "reposts": 56,
   "replies": 2,
