   "query": "Anthropic"
  },
  {
   "text": "Someone on twitter said “OpenAI is doing math how people normally do software engineering” and that seems accurate to me so far",
   "handle": "gracekind.net",
   "display_name": "Grace",
   "likes": 282,
   "reposts": 26,
   "replies": 3,
   "created_at": "2026-10-09T03:55:13.648Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/gracekind.net/post/3mxg3cgfpekdz",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "OpenAI"
  },
  {
   "text": "AI workers seem to fall into insular cultishness and this piece below says it's gotten to an extreme at Anthropic. I suspect their notions of consciousness are mechanistic, whether it's about us or their machines.",
   "handle": "rebeccasolnit.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Rebecca Solnit",
   "likes": 191,
   "reposts": 52,
   "replies": 3,
   "created_at": "2026-10-09T15:58:02.037Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/rebeccasolnit.bsky.social/post/3mxhdovpxpc27",
   "image": "",
   "external": "https://futurism.com/future-society/cult-anthropic-insiders-worshipping-claude-god?ref=meditationsinanemergency.com",
   "query": "Anthropic"
  },
  {
   "text": "also, your periodic reminder that anthropic models do not generate images. anthropic is the only US frontier lab that has been responsible on this one, whether on purpose or not. i will once again ask people to focus on real problems and not make things up just because you're mad at anthropic today.",
   "handle": "hailey.at",
   "display_name": "hailey",
   "likes": 184,
   "reposts": 6,
   "replies": 3,
   "created_at": "2026-10-09T00:14:51.809Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/hailey.at/post/3mxfoyf35bc2n",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "Anthropic"
  },
  {
   "text": "Far less fanfare and media panic now that the proofs are proving to be, err... unproven.\naiweekly.co/alerts/opena...",
   "handle": "colinhoad.com",
   "display_name": "Colin Hoad",
   "likes": 114,
   "reposts": 38,
   "replies": 9,
   "created_at": "2026-10-09T08:51:23.346Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/colinhoad.com/post/3mxgltyvs4k27",
   "image": "",
   "external": "https://aiweekly.co/alerts/openai-pulls-three-ai-generated-math-papers-over-sign-error",
   "query": "OpenAI"
  },
  {
   "text": "The three fired workers say OpenAI punished them for being outspoken about safety. The company disputes the claims and says they were fired over mishandling sensitive information. n.pr/4jOjWW7",
   "handle": "npr.org",
   "display_name": "NPR",
   "likes": 116,
   "reposts": 34,
   "replies": 7,
   "created_at": "2026-10-09T21:47:22.084700Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/npr.org/post/3mxhx7ktoyt2t",
   "image": "",
   "external": "https://n.pr/4jOjWW7",
   "query": "OpenAI"
  },
  {
   "text": "Even the headshot was AI, OpenAI says. Its verification tool shows the author photo and content on an \"Ervin Hoskins\" op-ed in the Port St. Joe Star came from OpenAI tools, part of an Iran-based “influence campaign” that placed about 100 fake articles in at least 20 American outlets.",
   "handle": "justinhendrix.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Justin Hendrix",
   "likes": 81,
   "reposts": 51,
   "replies": 4,
   "created_at": "2026-10-09T10:52:25.613Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/justinhendrix.bsky.social/post/3mxgsmgqnos2q",
   "image": "",
   "external": "https://www.washingtonpost.com/technology/2026/10/09/chatgpt-users-iran-planted-ai-generated-articles-us-news-media/",
   "query": "OpenAI"
  },
  {
   "text": "so people can say this, but i would also highlight that anthropic models _are_ the most well aligned when it comes to bigotry and abuse. anthropic clearly does not like violence against women or minorities either\n\nthis is not the reason to come up with to be mad at anthropic imo",
